== 4. маркировка: RESTRICTED и категории задать нельзя ==

$ python3 ../snapshot/core/model_constructor.py add-class sdf_secret --root-type PERSON --name S --tenant-id tnt_demo --marking-level RESTRICTED
                                      [--created-by usr_…|svc_…]
                                      [--created-at ISO8601] [--version N]
                                      [--marking-level LEVEL]
                                      [--out FILE.json]
                                      sdf_…
model_constructor.py add-class: error: argument --marking-level: invalid choice: 'RESTRICTED' (choose from 'PUBLIC', 'INTERNAL', 'CONFIDENTIAL')
(exit 2)

== 5. атрибуты класса: есть ли параметр? ==
0

== 6. add-iddef: невалидное регулярное выражение принимается ==

$ python3 ../snapshot/core/model_constructor.py add-iddef sdf_id_bad --scheme ru.inn --applies-to ORGANIZATION --strength WEAK --val-regex ([ --tenant-id tnt_demo
  "marking": {
    "level": "INTERNAL",
    "categories": []
  },
  "validation_regex": "(["
}
(exit 0)

== 7. add-link: незарегистрированный предикат; created-at из будущего ==

$ python3 ../snapshot/core/model_constructor.py add-link sdf_lnk_x --predicate-id no.such_thing --domain-class-id sdf_a1 --range-class-id sdf_b1 --cardinality ONE --tenant-id tnt_demo --created-at 2099-01-01T00:00:00Z
  "created_by": "usr_test_admin",
  "marking": {
    "level": "INTERNAL",
    "categories": []
  }
}
(exit 0)
